{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1181984,\"title\":\"David Hockney: In Normandy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The celebrated British artist discusses his life and work with Melvyn Bragg in his Normandy studio, revealing his influences, inspirations and plans to keep on painting.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jRqh9Vghjsdz4MMxu5yHKRKFrUB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2023,\"runtime\":40,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Suzannah Wander\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1307092,\"name\":\"Suzannah Wander\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1102300,\"name\":\"David Hockney\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mUPzSASAKnpR9FjkUXz7LcOfKv5.jpg\"},{\"id\":72744,\"name\":\"Melvyn Bragg\",\"character\":\"self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fT3m5FRLXX5U2Y2olSeTKO0m9wR.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":252511,\"title\":\"The Kingdom of Dreams and Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ice7zuzzwcuKO5SJG7aTqYZC3EI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muaflceN4wem4NTHXifCRj8upMh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follows the behind-the-scenes work of Studio Ghibli, focusing on the notable figures Hayao Miyazaki, Isao Takahata, and Toshio Suzuki.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":413765,\"title\":\"David Lynch: The Art Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pgtQceTZKylB2B237t18h2pOXpE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9qMP1aquRST8XfJ58EqTMAZ9kA6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An intimate journey through the formative years of David Lynch's life. From his idyllic upbringing in small town America to the dark streets of Philadelphia, we follow Lynch as he traces the events that have helped to shape one of cinema's most enigmatic directors.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":467441,\"title\":\"David Choe: High Risk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ztluYKvCUgmgDgVs6iNjQhbpe8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Artist David Choe has led a life of high risk, from hedonistic excesses to being imprisoned at a maximum security facility in a foreign country, and yet has been dramatically rewarded for his exploits. Life didn't change much when he traded a $60k fee in favor of stock in a start-up called The Facebook, but now he is estimated to be worth over $250 million, highlighting a colorful career filled with giant street art installations, porn star affairs and investigative reporting for companies like Vice and CNN. Director and childhood friend Harry Kim guides us through the fantastically surreal life of Choe featuring interviews and appearances by Kevin Smith, Eli Roth, Sasha Grey, Sean Parker, and Shepard Fairey.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844179,\"title\":\"All About Yves Montand\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/axvF1gRswpGbXYIRtmYhkXj4pq5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eaWfiwAVGRXFCzrxBa9MmPugqSj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yves Montand would have been 100-years-old in 2021. A journey through the 20th century by the son of an Italian immigrant who reached the peak of his art and popularity. The song, the cinema, the commitments, a film all in archives.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":654170,\"title\":\"The Painter and the Thief\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldcenmrQen5x8ZJ4NerYhXESc8z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xgje6VloPsZtGW0KCt24RbDismZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When two of artist Barbora Kysilkova’s most valuable paintings are stolen from a gallery at Frogner in Oslo, the police are able to find the thief after a few days, but the paintings are nowhere to be found. Barbora goes to the trial in hopes of finding clues, but instead she ends up asking the thief if she can paint a portrait of him. This will be the start of a very unusual friendship. Over three years, the cinematic documentary follows the incredible story of the artist looking for her stolen paintings, while at the same time turning the thief into art.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":651304,\"title\":\"I'm in Love with Pippa Bacca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oi28aNQHway4dihfcbL98AIzJTz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vQCqWAtMYUALjbzYGiRQuk1t4SO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Giuseppina Pasqualino di Marineo, better known as Pippa Bacca, was a 34 years old Italian artist.  She crossed 11 countries involved in wars, hitchhiking with another Milanese artist, Silvia Moro, both wearing a wedding dress.  This was a performance for peace, trust and hoping to prove that if you rely on others, you’ll receive good things only.  After travelling many roads, the two artists decided to split for a while in Istanbul, planning to meet again in Byblos. Pippa left then, alone, and nobody heard from her again.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1237871,\"title\":\"Secret Mall Apartment\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nc6ZQMlQrCq03d1WXyYaeUXRlCY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3VIMY3CKqrMR5MjiJ3rd6khPRn5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2003, eight Rhode Islanders created a secret apartment inside a busy mall and lived there for four years, filming everything along the way. Far more than a prank, the secret apartment became a deeply meaningful place for all involved.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":278772,\"title\":\"Serial Killer Culture\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g6GvNZlHrYPlJVCssNeGUZJulBl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ge2Gyj1owNgg4VjBNxgk29tXVgf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Serial Killer Culture examines the reasons why artists and collectors are fascinated by serial killers.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844039,\"title\":\"Kokoschka: Work and Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/49YmDp7nYpxZ4JYLQuyUMqMNWLJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mt2qtMs8RYdlrPZjXXy0moNx12F.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Painter, poet and playwright, teacher and freethinker, lover and traveler, Austrian artist Oskar Kokoschka (1886-1980) was a rare individual who remained lucid and passionate throughout his long life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844240,\"title\":\"Paint Until Dawn: a documentary on art in the life of James Gahagan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8sQxlkrih7dZ6XtLMcKMsfk3PL7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ckr8lELqKCXtHq244D1OQ18zIhD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seeing is to painting what listening is to politics. Survival as an artist demands both. Paint Until Dawn is a documentary on art in the life of James Gahagan (1927-1999), who painted all night to push the limits of vision. His life and thought reveal a correlation between art and activism through an interesting angle: the creative process itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1044681,\"title\":\"Le Coureur de fond\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26Vll37eboEpg8Ae077332hw4Re.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463502,\"title\":\"Where do they all go?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7c5C70pz5vybfv1Fd61UI7IIiHF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"94-year old Esther, a pensioner with bad sight, is in search of her artist daugther’s public decoration. Endless phone conversations takes her through municipal bureaucracy and lost culture secretaries. Will she ever get an answer to the eternal question: Where does the art really go?\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"EmeoGlh89zg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"WGRjOzQ-S40\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"TUsjBK3q58k\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}